  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28f310e05cc019a48855581da30b411e, type: 3}
  m_Name: PancitCantonHistory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: For this level  Pancit Canton! Let's discover why these noodles have become
      such a staple.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Let me tell you the history and origin of pancit canton.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Pancit reflects the influence of Chinese immigrants and traders who brought
      noodle-making traditions to the Philippines.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Over time, Filipino cooks adapted these dishes to local ingredients and
      tastes, creating many regional varieties.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Pancit Canton is usually stir-fried with wheat noodles, vegetables, meat,
      seafood, and savory seasonings.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: "It is enjoyed as an everyday meal and is especially popular at birthdays
      and family gatherings.\r"
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: "Did you know?\r"
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: Long noodles are traditionally associated with long life and good fortune,
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: which is why pancit is often served at Filipino birthday celebrations!
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
